#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_39.php:158
msgid "The <code>App::url()->type</code> property is no longer accessible as of <strong>Dotclear 2.39</strong> (released on August 13, 2026), but is still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by replacing <code>App::url()->type</code> with <code>App::url()->getType()</code>)."
msgstr ""

#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_39.php:163
