#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_41.php:164
msgid "Some distributed themes may appear in this list if you copied them to a directory other than Dotclear's <var>themes</var> directory.<br>In that case, we recommend deleting them from your custom directory and using the button labeled “ Add the distributed themes here ” on the blog's appearance page."
msgstr ""

#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_40.php:162
msgid "The <code>App::backend()->popup</code> property is no longer accessible as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>, but is still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by replacing <code>App::backend()->popup === 1</code> with <code>App::backend()->isPopup()</code>).<br><br>Also the <code>App::backend()->plugin_id</code> property is no longer accessible as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>, but is still present in the following modules.<br>You should review and update them (by replacing <code>App::backend()->plugin_id === 'admin.blog.theme'</code> with <code>MediaItem::isPopup()</code>)."
msgstr ""

#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_40.php:165
msgid "Note that these modifications do not cause any issues with Dotclear 2.40 <strong>if and only if</strong> the <var>DC_MODERN</var> constant is set to <samp>false</samp> (or does not appear at all) in the configuration file (<var>inc/config.php</var>)."
msgstr ""

#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_40.php:293
msgid "The 2nd and 3rd argument of <code>WidgetsElement::checkHomeOnly()</code> are no longer taken into account as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_40.php:417
msgid "The 6th argument of <code>WidgetsElement::setting()</code> are no longer taken into account as of <strong>Dotclear 2.40</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: ../git-plugins/PreCheck/src/Version/Version_2_41.php:159
